
% Don't Leave Me Alone

a: I ii | vi | IV V | vi |
In: I ii | vi | IV V | vi |
outro: I ii | vi | IV V | vi |
a_sub: I ii | vi | IV iii | vi |
Vr: $a $a_sub
PCh: $a*2
Ch: $a*2
DCh: $a*2
a_drop: I ii | vi | IV V | R |
bridge: $a $a_drop
S: [G] $In $Vr $PCh $Ch $DCh $Vr $PCh $Ch $DCh $bridge $Ch*2 $outro
